<div id="id1" class="ltx_titlepage">
<p id="id1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="id1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps" style="font-size:144%;">MSc Artificial Intelligence
<br class="ltx_break" style="--ltx-break-space:5.7pt;"></span></p>
