<br class="ltx_break" style="--ltx-break-space:11.4pt;"></p>
<p id="id1.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="id1.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:207%;">Poolformer: Recurrent Networks with Pooling for Long-Sequence Modeling
<br class="ltx_break" style="--ltx-break-space:11.4pt;"></span></p>
<p id="id1.5" class="ltx_p"><span class="ltx_rule" style="width:345.0pt;height:1.4pt;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>
<br class="ltx_break" style="--ltx-break-space:14.2pt;"></p>
<p id="id1.6" class="ltx_p">by
<br class="ltx_break" style="--ltx-break-space:5.7pt;"></p>
<p id="id1.7" class="ltx_p"><span id="id1.7.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps" style="font-size:144%;">Daniel Gallo Fernández
<br class="ltx_break" style="--ltx-break-space:5.7pt;"></span></p>
<p id="id1.8" class="ltx_p">15110664
<br class="ltx_break" style="--ltx-break-space:28.5pt;"></p>
<p id="id1.9" class="ltx_p"><span id="id1.9.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:144%;">June 29, 2025
<br class="ltx_break" style="--ltx-break-space:28.5pt;"></span></p>
<p id="id1.10" class="ltx_p">36 ECTS
<br class="ltx_break"></p>
<p id="id1.11" class="ltx_p">January 2025 - June 2025
<br class="ltx_break" style="--ltx-break-space:28.5pt;"></p>
<div id="id1.12" class="ltx_block ltx_minipage ltx_align_top" style="width:138.0pt;">
<p id="id1.12.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><em id="id1.12.1.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:120%;">Supervisor:</em><span id="id1.12.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:120%;"> 
<br class="ltx_break"></span></p>
